{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>It will not profit</b> — the wealth of traitors will not profit them on the day that HaShem abhors them." "<b>And righteousness</b> — will deliver the upright from the death of traitors, or it will deliver them so that they do not die except at old age."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:22:03.187956460Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}